   Pattern  : stack-upgrade/msaccess-frm-to-dotnet10-mvc-e2e  Phase 12 — Razor Views (Step 18)
   Migrated : 2026-07-01
   Security review : Phase 14 — Pre-Build Security Review Gate (2026-07-01) — PASS (no changes required)

