     - HTML prototype: source/ui/fps/test_lists_for_VLA.html
     - JS prototype   : source/ui/fps/testList_VLA.js
     - Main grid (testListVlaGrid) + 3-tab sub-grid panel (Test Requirements, Component Charges, Suppliers)
     - GOV.UK tabs structure replicated from HTML prototype govuk-tabs div (3 panels)
     - No page-level filter dropdowns — HTML has no explicit <select> outside grid containers
     - Five DataGridConfig instances rendered via shared _DataGrid partial
     - CRUD JS functions (add/edit/delete) for main grid and each tab grid
     - Tab grid row-selection JS: clicking a TestListVla row updates child tab grid titles and reloads
     - Component Charges tab shows computed summary fields: component-total and vla-unit-price

   PRESERVED:
     - HTML prototype breadcrumb row structure (fps-sr-breadcrumb-row)
     - Tab IDs and panel IDs matching HTML prototype exactly
     - Summary computed fields (stage2-component-total, stage2-vla-unit-price) in Component Charges tab

   PHASE 14 SECURITY REVIEW FINDINGS (no code changes required):
     - HTML encoding  : all Razor @-expressions auto-encode; no @Html.Raw() present — PASS
     - Inline scripts : var selectedTestCode initialised to empty string (not from @Model or @ViewData);
                        all runtime values sourced from jQuery .data() HTML attributes — PASS
     - URL encoding   : encodeURIComponent() applied to every user-supplied value in AJAX DELETE URL
                        query strings (itemCode, testCode, buyer, profitCentre) — PASS
     - No secrets     : all AJAX endpoints use relative paths only; no hardcoded credentials,
                        tenant IDs, or absolute environment-specific URLs — PASS
     - $.ajax DELETE CSRF gap: AJAX DELETE calls do not include RequestVerificationToken header;
                        [ValidateAntiForgeryToken] absent on MVC controller DELETE actions — this
                        gap was recorded as FAIL/DEFERRED in the Phase 14 MVC controller batch and
                        requires a coordinated JS + controller fix across all FPS area views — DEFERRED
     - response.message in alert(): server-supplied error text surfaced to user via alert(); server-
                        side already confirmed not to expose stack traces or connection strings
                        (Phase 14 controller review PASS) — acceptable; low residual risk — NOTED

   DEFERRED / REQUIRES HUMAN REVIEW:
     - TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: selectedTestCode state is held in JS; on initial page load the sub-grids
       are empty until the user clicks a TestListVla row — this mirrors the HTML prototype behaviour.
     - TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: stage2-total-required field appears in JS updateStage2Summaries() but NOT
       in the HTML prototype markup — omitted here; add if required.
     - TRANSFORMENGINE TODO: CSRF/anti-forgery on AJAX DELETE and modal POST calls requires coordinated
